5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m so excited to pick our next big show! I really want to make sure we don’t get blindsided by hidden costs later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Mio, hidden costs are real, but so is our capacity. We need to know who is actually available to execute this, not just the budget.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Mio, excitement is cheap. Victoria, capacity is a constraint, not a strategy. We need data on what actually works, not just what fits.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The floor’s load limits are non-negotiable. We must verify structural integrity before promising the space to any curator.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the quiet moments when things go wrong. Let’s see where past deliveries actually stumbled, not just where they were planned.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I totally agree! Let’s check the loan transport costs and the maintenance logs for powered displays to catch those sneaky expenses early.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, capacity is the strategy. I will review the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster to see who is actually left to do the work.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, your focus is narrow. I will examine the weekend head counts and visitor comment slips to see what audiences actually value.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
