35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, did you find similar transport spikes? I’m shocked that shipping ate a third of our installation budget!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, the numbers are stark. One conservator, two hundred pieces. The volunteers are already committed elsewhere. We are understaffed before we even begin.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your staffing crisis is a symptom, not the cause. The data is clear: people return for presence, not objects.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, your budget concerns are secondary. The bay is capped at four hundred kilos per square metre. Any proposal exceeding that is structurally impossible.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, yes, the paperwork delays were painful. Two recent shows slipped because documents arrived late. We must plan for those quiet, frustrating gaps.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that confirms it! Shipping is a budget killer. I’m also worried about mount-making costs, which have doubled. We need to avoid expensive custom work.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, presence requires people. With one conservator and volunteers tied up, who physically stands in the room? We cannot mount what we cannot staff.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you confuse logistics with value. The data proves audiences return for interaction, not just objects. We must prioritize presence, regardless of your staffing fears.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Victoria, staffing is a variable. The bay’s load limit is a constant. If the floor fails, no one stands in the room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, you are right to be firm. I will gently check the paperwork and transport costs to ensure our deliveries arrive safely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, presence is great, but if the joiner’s rate doubles, we can’t afford the custom mounts! We need self-supporting pieces to save money.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, presence is a luxury we cannot afford. With one conservator and volunteers tied up, who physically stands in the room? We cannot mount what we cannot staff.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you mistake scarcity for strategy. The data is undeniable: presence drives return visits. We must prioritize the experience, not your staffing anxieties.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, presence is irrelevant if the bay collapses. Fourteen call-outs last season prove powered displays are liabilities. We need static, lightweight objects.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, I hear your worry. Let’s ensure our paperwork is perfect so the floor never has to bear the weight of our mistakes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, static and lightweight is perfect! It saves on mounts and keeps the bay safe. Let’s prioritize those self-supporting pieces!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Asuka, static pieces still require conservation. With one conservator and two hundred pieces waiting, we cannot guarantee their safety. We must respect the physical limits of our staff.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, static objects are dead weight. The data shows movement drives return visits. We need dynamic displays, not your fragile, lifeless relics.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your data ignores physics. The bay cannot support dynamic weight. We choose static, lightweight pieces to ensure the building survives the season.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I understand your passion. But let us not forget the quiet cost of delays. We must ensure our paperwork is flawless to avoid those painful gaps.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
